  "claim_localizations": [
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1220-vsevolod-court-armed-in-armour","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Летопись под 1220 годом сообщает, что князь Всеволод пришёл со всем двором, вооружённым в броне. Это один конфликтный эпизод, не инвентарь, навык или защита персонажа.","search_aliases":["броня","Всеволод","1220"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1220-vsevolod-court-armed-in-armour","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The chronicle for 1220 says Prince Vsevolod came with his whole court armed in armour. It is one conflict episode, not a character inventory, skill, or protection value.","search_aliases":["armour","Vsevolod","1220"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1220-tverdislav-supporters-five-regiments","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Летопись под 1220 годом сообщает, что сторонники Твердислава стояли пятью полками. Это одна кризисная расстановка, не постоянная военная организация.","search_aliases":["Твердислав","пять полков"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1220-tverdislav-supporters-five-regiments","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The 1220 chronicle says Tverdislav’s supporters stood in five regiments. It is one crisis arrangement, not a standing military organization.","search_aliases":["Tverdislav","five regiments"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1220-mitrofan-mediated-reconciliation","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Под 1220 годом летопись рассказывает, что архиепископ Митрофан примирил князя Всеволода и Твердислава. Это один эпизод, не общее полномочие или процедура.","search_aliases":["Митрофан","примирение"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1220-mitrofan-mediated-reconciliation","locale":"en","runtime_text":"For 1220 the chronicle recounts Archbishop Mitrofan reconciling Prince Vsevolod and Tverdislav. It is one episode, not a general competence or procedure.","search_aliases":["Mitrofan","reconciliation"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1220-tverdislav-ivanko-posadnichestvo","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Летопись под 1220 годом сообщает, что Твердислав оставил посадничество, а Иванко Дмитрович его получил. Это не правило избрания, срока или полномочий.","search_aliases":["посадничество","Иванко","Твердислав"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1220-tverdislav-ivanko-posadnichestvo","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The 1220 chronicle says Tverdislav relinquished the posadnichestvo and Ivanko Dmitrovich received it. It is not a rule of election, tenure, or competence.","search_aliases":["posadnichestvo","Ivanko","Tverdislav"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1222-novgorod-delegation-to-vladimir","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Под 1222 годом летопись сообщает об отправке Митрофана, посадника Иванка и старейших мужей из Новгорода к Юрию во Владимир. Это именованная делегация, не общий институт дипломатии.","search_aliases":["Владимир","делегация","Митрофан","Иванко"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1222-novgorod-delegation-to-vladimir","locale":"en","runtime_text":"For 1222 the chronicle records Novgorod sending Mitrofan, Posadnik Ivanko, and senior men to Yuri in Vladimir. It is a named delegation, not a general diplomatic institution.","search_aliases":["Vladimir","delegation","Mitrofan","Ivanko"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1222-yuri-gives-vsevolod","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Летопись под 1222 годом говорит, что Юрий дал сына Всеволода «на всей воле новгородской». Это формулировка одного события, не конституционное правило или текущая власть.","search_aliases":["Юрий","Всеволод","воля новгородская"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1222-yuri-gives-vsevolod","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The 1222 chronicle says Yuri gave his son Vsevolod ‘on all the will of Novgorod’. It is wording for one event, not a constitutional rule or current authority.","search_aliases":["Yuri","Vsevolod","will of Novgorod"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1222-kesi-campaign","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Под 1222 годом летопись сообщает о походе новгородцев со Святославом к Кеси, литовской помощи и невзятии города. Это один поход, не постоянный союз или осадная возможность.","search_aliases":["Кесь","Святослав","Литва"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1222-kesi-campaign","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The 1222 chronicle records Novgorodians with Svyatoslav going to Kesi, Lithuanian help, and the town not being taken. It is one campaign, not a standing alliance or siege capability.","search_aliases":["Kesi","Svyatoslav","Lithuania"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1223-yaroslav-colyvan-campaign","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Под 1223 годом летопись сообщает о походе Ярослава к Колываню со всей областью, разорении Чудской земли и невзятии города. Это один эпизод, не политика или текущая экспедиция.","search_aliases":["Колывань","Ярослав","поход"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1223-yaroslav-colyvan-campaign","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The 1223 chronicle records Yaroslav going to Kolivan with his whole oblast, ravaging Chud land, and not taking the town. It is one episode, not policy or a current expedition.","search_aliases":["Kolivan","Yaroslav","campaign"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1223-colyvan-captives-and-gold","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"В записи о походе к Колывани под 1223 годом летопись говорит о приведённых пленниках и большом количестве золота. Это описанный итог именно этого похода, не право или обычный результат.","search_aliases":["Колывань","плен","золото"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1223-colyvan-captives-and-gold","locale":"en","runtime_text":"In its 1223 Kolivan campaign account, the chronicle says captives and much gold were brought back. It is that campaign’s narrated aftermath, not an entitlement or ordinary result.","search_aliases":["Kolivan","captives","gold"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1220-tverdislav-wife-children-monastic-event","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Под 1220 годом летопись сообщает, что Твердислав ушёл в монастырь, скрывшись от жены и детей, а его жена затем поступила в другой монастырь. Это один семейный эпизод, не норма брака, гендера или монашества.","search_aliases":["Твердислав","жена","дети","монастырь"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-npl-1220-tverdislav-wife-children-monastic-event","locale":"en","runtime_text":"For 1220 the chronicle says Tverdislav left wife and children for a monastery, and his wife then entered another monastery. It is one household event, not a marital, gender, or monastic norm.","search_aliases":["Tverdislav","wife","children","monastery"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-gramota9-gostyata-reports-property-from-father-and-kin","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Грамота №9 передаёт слова Гостяты о том, что отец и родня дали ей имущество. Это утверждение в одном письме, не правило имущества, наследования или гендера.","search_aliases":["Гостята","имущество","родня"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-gramota9-gostyata-reports-property-from-father-and-kin","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Letter 9 reports Gostyata saying that her father and kin gave her property. It is an assertion in one letter, not a rule of property, inheritance, or gender.","search_aliases":["Gostyata","property","kin"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-gramota9-reports-another-wife","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Грамота №9 передаёт жалобу Гостяты, что её выгнали после того, как была взята другая жена. Это содержание одной жалобы, не норма брака, развода или санкции.","search_aliases":["Гостята","другая жена","жалоба"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-gramota9-reports-another-wife","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Letter 9 reports Gostyata’s complaint that she was driven away after another wife was taken. It is one complaint’s content, not a rule of marriage, divorce, or sanction.","search_aliases":["Gostyata","another wife","complaint"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-gramota531-anna-asks-brother-klimyata-protection","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Грамота №531 — ранняя XIII-вековая частная просьба Анны к брату Климате о защите от предполагаемого обвинения. Это единичная родственная просьба, не система статуса, права или хозяйства.","search_aliases":["Анна","Климатя","защита","обвинение"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-gramota531-anna-asks-brother-klimyata-protection","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Letter 531 is an early-thirteenth-century private request by Anna to her brother Klimyata for protection against an alleged accusation. It is one kin-directed request, not a system of status, law, or household.","search_aliases":["Anna","Klimyata","protection","accusation"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-gramota778-early-thirteenth-century-alphabet-exercise","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Каталог gramoty.ru относит грамоту №778 к раннему XIII веку и классифицирует её как азбучное упражнение. Это не школа, программа, грамотность или ученик в сцене.","search_aliases":["грамота 778","азбука","упражнение"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-gramota778-early-thirteenth-century-alphabet-exercise","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The gramoty.ru catalogue dates letter 778 to the early thirteenth century and classifies it as an alphabet exercise. It is not a school, curriculum, literacy rate, or learner in a scene.","search_aliases":["letter 778","alphabet","exercise"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-gramota907-letter-to-posadnik-theft-inquiry","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Каталог gramoty.ru описывает более раннее письмо к посаднику по поводу розыска кражи. Это не судебный порядок, юрисдикция, санкция или текущее обвинение.","search_aliases":["посадник","кража","розыск"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-gramota907-letter-to-posadnik-theft-inquiry","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The gramoty.ru catalogue identifies an earlier letter to a posadnik about a theft inquiry. It is not court procedure, jurisdiction, sanction, or a current accusation.","search_aliases":["posadnik","theft","inquiry"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-museum-x-xvii-novgorod-archaeological-collection","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Новгородский музей описывает около 100 археологических предметов X–XVII веков из раскопок Великого Новгорода, включая игрушки, церы и писала. Это широкий музейный контекст, не присутствие предмета в 1230 году или сцене.","search_aliases":["археология","цера","писало","игрушки"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-museum-x-xvii-novgorod-archaeological-collection","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The Novgorod Museum describes about 100 archaeological objects from X–XVII-century Veliky Novgorod excavations, including toys, writing tablets, and styli. It is broad museum context, not object presence in 1230 or a scene.","search_aliases":["archaeology","writing tablet","stylus","toys"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-museum-onfim-learning-writing-reading-counting","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Экспозиционный текст Новгородского музея описывает берестяные грамоты Онфима как записи, на которых он учился письму, чтению и счёту. Это музейный контекст, не датированная школа, программа или ребёнок в сцене.","search_aliases":["Онфим","письмо","чтение","счёт"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-museum-onfim-learning-writing-reading-counting","locale":"en","runtime_text":"A Novgorod Museum exhibition text describes Onfim’s birch-bark letters as ones in which he learned writing, reading, and counting. It is museum context, not a dated school, curriculum, or child in a scene.","search_aliases":["Onfim","writing","reading","counting"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-museum-individual-toy-types","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Новгородский музей описывает индивидуальные игрушки-имитации оружия и транспорта, а также изобразительные, звуковые и механические игрушки. Это археологический контекст, не оружие, игрушка, ребёнок или навык в сцене.","search_aliases":["игрушка","лук","лодочка","свистулька"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:candidate-v7-museum-individual-toy-types","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The Novgorod Museum describes individual toys as weapon and transport imitations and as figurative, sound, and mechanical toys. It is archaeological context, not a weapon, toy, child, or skill in a scene.","search_aliases":["toy","bow","toy boat","whistle"]},
